/**
 * Water & Cloud Gen 2 fish registry (real fish items).
 * <p>
 * Design rules (kept separate from the Gen 1 Dreamweaver Fish system):
 * <ul>
 *   <li>Fish species data only describes "base five-element vector (main element lean) + rarity + model material + lore";</li>
 *   <li>Each fish's own attributes (five element values + quality multiplier) are generated by {@link FishAttributeGenerator} the moment it's caught, and saved to PDC;</li>
 *   <li>Common fish (isCommon=true) are shared by all three zones; special fish (isCommon=false) can only be caught with the matching bait.</li>
 *   <li>Gene type (Trait): each species has a default gene type (Speed / Synthesis). Wild catches use the default; bred babies override it using the inheritance rules.</li>
 * </ul>
 * The five elements are always in this order: Fire, Water, Thunder, Wind, Earth. The sum is always 1.0.
 */
